fferent places including the different stories of the five main heroines, three side routes, one hidden route, and three bonus stories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/542290/extras/2d0abde7a9c2ae459c8ae0b672b6ea83.poster.avif?t=1767633081\" width=780 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/542290/extras/2d0abde7a9c2ae459c8ae0b672b6ea83.webm?t=1767633081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day you'll have several choices on where to go and what to do, allowing you to spend time with the different characters and cultivate your bonds with them. These choices, along with your dialogue choices, will determine how your story progresses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/542290/extras/bd32b642460f5d09fe61a89cdfa8882b.poster.avif?t=1767633081\" width=780 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/542290/extras/bd32b642460f5d09fe61a89cdfa8882b.webm?t=1767633081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/542290/extras/c9364aa352d9aa2b31e10d448cf0b772.avif?t=1767633081\" width=780 height=318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/542290/extras/740052784ef390e6dc3eb50c41188b02.avif?t=1767633081\" width=780 height=318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/542290/extras/c9f49ba950d19b76417156156bb838df.avif?t=1767633081\" width=780 height=318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/542290/extras/3e61783cc04176dd55c82b7f42f6ca96.avif?t=1767633081\" width=780 height=318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/542290/extras/69549fccebf38a0af4d1606f981f7c08.avif?t=1767633081\" width=780 height=318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/542290/extras/58e1478b1840c3f238aa2f5149152db0.avif?t=1767633081\" width=780 height=404 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Much like the music term the title is derived from, the story will build and deepen with every playthrough. Each route will reveal new information about the characters and the setting, but there will be subtle differences that grow as well until the tale being woven reaches its true finale.</p>",
